# Docker build-context trims. The root context is used by
# infra/vps/portal.Dockerfile (portal + packages/tokens only); the backend
# image builds with backend/ as its own context (see backend/.dockerignore).
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.open-next
**/.wrangler
**/.expo
**/dist-export
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
backend/
mobile/
docs/
scripts/
.github/
infra/
